      "content": "Here are a few options, depending on how direct you want to be. You could try something like: \"Team, as we approach month-end, let's focus on tightening up our manual data entry for inventory and shipping manifests. Even small discrepancies are adding up, so a quick double-check on those entries will save us a lot of headache during reconciliation. Thanks for helping us keep our data as clean as possible!\"\n\nIf you want it even lighter, you could go with: \"Hey Ops, just a friendly heads-up—we've noticed a few tiny hiccups in the inventory logs and shipping manifests lately. Let's all put an extra layer of focus on those manual entries to keep things smooth for month-end. Appreciate the extra diligence!\"",
      "source": "target",
